    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s7102 SNOMED CT 84667006 = ICF bones of the neck region. The bony skeleton of the neck is
        the cervical vertebral column plus the hyoid; SNOMED CT has no single active concept. The best
        defensible standard target is Athena 4223068 (sctid 84667006), which covers the dominant
        skeletal component of the neck region and subsumes the principal neck bones. One-level broader
        (covers the cervical spine axis of the source; hyoid is a minor component not separately listed
        at this level); high tier.
        """
}
