mapping "s73003.1" source="s73003" target="SNOMED_CT:181777002" relationship=partial_overlap effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s73003 SNOMED CT 181777002 bundles TWO components: ligaments (ledband) AND fasciae
        (muskelhinnor) of the upper arm. SNOMED CT has no single concept for the combination. 181777002
        (Athena 4056382), sv, covers only the fascia axis (partial). No upper-arm-specific ligament
        concept exists in SNOMED CT (ligaments at the elbow/shoulder are joint-specific); the closest is
        41821009 which is broader. Recorded the fascia target as the defensible partial; the ligament
        axis has no upper-arm-specific concept. Partial (one target per component); moderate tier
        because only one of two components is defensibly mapped.
        """
}
